"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"familiar","description":{"value":"<p>It understands and speaks a language you know.</p>","gm":""},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder Player Core","authors":""},"rules":[],"traits":{"value":[],"otherTags":[]},"slug":"speech","_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.364","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.2.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.familiar-abilities.Item.zyMRLQnFCQVpltiR","createdTime":1783208004229,"modifiedTime":1783208004235,"lastModifiedBy":"rRqGmfO5dCn3oNkd","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"rRqGmfO5dCn3oNkd":3},"flags":{"pf2e":{"grantedBy":{"id":"RNP9ndHQxqFaiHEJ","onDelete":"cascade"}}},"_id":"m9cp6XybQZOVKH8H"},{"name":"Gibe","type":"action","effects":[],"system":{"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":{"schema":0.935,"foundry":"14.364","system":"8.2.0"}},"description":{"value":"<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per round</p><hr><p><strong>Effect</strong> The mockingfey takes on the imperfect, illusory appearance of a creature it can see within 60 feet, pantomiming the mannerisms in a derisive fashion. This illusion doesn't make the mockingfey look any larger and lasts until the end of your next turn.<br>The creature must attempt a @Check[type:will|dc:resolve(@actor.master.attributes.classOrSpellDC.value)] save against your class DC or spell DC, whichever is the higher. Regardless of the result, the creature is immune for 1 minute.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{off-guard} until the start of your next turn, as it's distracted by your familiar's taunts.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is off-guard until the end of your next turn</p><p></p>","gm":""},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Lost Omens Riv